## Objective
- Act as the autonomous bug-bounty agent defined by `skills/AGENT.md`: test only `account.ui.com` (from `data/targets.txt`), enumerate UI routes + APIs, test each route one-by-one (client-side then server-side), and document evidence in `result/`.
- Create two test accounts on the target; if impossible, test unauthenticated surface only. Maintain a progress report and send a Discord webhook notification only for a genuinely confirmed finding.

## Important Details
- Repo root: `/home/runner/work/aaii-aautomattionn-for-doomainn/aaii-aautomattionn-for-doomainn`; fresh start (prior state decision=reset, target hash changed).
- Scope: `account.ui.com` domain-only. `creds/test-account.txt` references `console.byteplus.com` → out of scope, not used.
- Documented assumption in `result/scope.md`: APIs directly invoked by `account.ui.com` routes (`sso.ui.com`, `sso.ubnt.com`, `account.svc.ui.com`, `geo.svc.ui.com`) are treated as required components; no roaming to unrelated subdomains.
- AGENT rules: practical evidence only, no destructive tests/DoS/brute force, no real-user data, record out-of-scope items in `result/out-of-scope.txt`.
- Tools: Chrome DevTools MCP works (pageId 2 selected), `google-chrome-stable` port 9222, node v22.23.4, python 3.14.4, curl; `rg` NOT installed (use python/grep).
- Bundle: `https://account.ui.com/assets/index-D5t7M7xo.js`, 7,121,868 bytes, sha256 `ce9950c975a42cac66f5c2ea759d655e96c441d34df6a6b8190b09d60ea1c468`; saved to `result/client-side/account.ui.com/_app/javascript/index-D5t7M7xo.js`. No source map (`.map` returns SPA HTML).
- Route table extracted (42 `path:` values): `/`, `/account`, `/activate`, `/backups`, `/billing`, `/billing/:orgId`, `/idp/login-result`, `/invoices`, `/invoices/:invoiceId`, `/login`, `/login/change-email`, `/login/change-email/confirm`, `/login/create-passkey`, `/login/mfa`, `/login/trust-device`, `/logout`, `/msp/idp/setup-result`, `/mysupport`, `/payments`, `/payments/3ds`, `/profile`, `/register`, `/requests`, `/requests/:ticketId`, `/reset-password`, `/reset-password/password-reset-uuid/:uuid`, `/security`, `/security/suspicious/confirm`, `/subscribe`, `/subscriptions`, `/subscriptions/:service`, `/subscriptions/cloud-storage/subscribe`, `/subscriptions/site-support/subscribe`, `/supportform`, `/supportform-uisp`, `/supportform-umr`, `/switch`, `/verify`, `/verify/verification-code/:uuid`, plus `/sso/account`, `/sso/installs`, `/sso/cancel_subscription` from string literals.
- Key JS config: `accountBE` base `https://account.svc.ui.com`; `ssoUi` base `https://sso.ui.com`; `sso` base `https://sso.ubnt.com`; endpoints include `/api/sso/v2/users` (createAccount), `/api/sso/v1/search/email/{e}`, `/api/sso/v1/search/username/{u}`, `/api/sso/v1/login/email`, `/api/sso/v1/password/{user}`, `/api/sso/v1/verify/password/{uuid}`, `/api/sso/v1/verify/verification-code/{uuid}`, `/api/sso/v1/verify/{type}/{username}`, `/api/sso/v1/account-chooser`, `/api/sso/v1/legal`, `/api/sso/v1/address/validator`, `/api/sso/v1/password-strength`, `/api/sso/v1/idp/login-result`.
- Redirect logic: `DQ(url)` parses `redirect`/`innerRedirect`; `MC()` allows only http/https hosts whose last two labels ∈ [`ubnt.com`,`ui.com`,`uisp.com`]; `Wpe()` requires innerRedirect start `/`, not `//`, no `\`, prefix-match allowlist `Lpe`; on login success `CQ()` does `window.location.replace(redirect)`. Assessed as not arbitrary open redirect.
- postMessage: main listener requires `e.source === window.parent` AND `$he(e.origin)` (`https://` + `MC`) then zod `safeParse`; MSP listener checks `origin === window.location.origin`; `/msp/idp/setup-result` posts to opener with targetOrigin `window.location.origin`. No issue found.
- XSS sinks: only 2 app-level `__html` (radix scroll-area style, html-react-parser library); `eval(`, `new Function`, `document.write` = 0. DOM XSS unlikely.
- reCAPTCHA keys: score key `Jzt`/`GOOGLE_RECAPTCHA_SECRET_SCORE` = `6LfGZXojAAAAAEtQpgRueRxoFwnjwe58b1exZGsS` (action `submit` lowercase); challenge key = `6LdWhNglAAAAAJB_RK6EWYVnSVyrohxdwy9WEkP8`; backend key = `6LfyUkwpAAAAAJ6-mN1q_IAe0bM8pit_lxc0anmv`.
- Registration payload: `{captcha, site_key:Jzt, email, username, password, curr_privacy_rev, curr_terms_rev, newsletter:{announcements,unifi,uisp}}` → `POST https://sso.ui.com/api/sso/v2/users`. Legal revs `REV2013-01-18`.
- CORS: `sso.ui.com` returns no ACAO for `evil.example`, `account.ui.com.evil.com`, `account.ui.com@evil.com`, `null`; returns `access-control-allow-origin` + `allow-credentials: true` for `https://account.ui.com`, `https://ui.com`, `https://evilaccount.ui.com` (any `*.ui.com`) — expected shared SSO, not reported.
- Unauth API probes: `GET /search/email/<fake>` 404, `/search/username/<fake>` 404 (existence oracle, excluded as low impact); `POST /login/email` → 400 `{"user_exists":false,"enforce_idp":false,"login_methods":[],"login_type":null}`; `POST /password/<fake>` → 400 requiring `_ubiquiti_private_key`, `apple_devicecheck_token` (not present in bundle); `GET /account-chooser` → 200 `{"accounts":[]}`; `GET /legal` → 200 JSON.
- Discord webhook URL from operator note not captured in this conversation; no notification sent (no confirmed finding).

