## Objective
- Act as the autonomous bug-bounty agent defined by `skills/AGENT.md`: test only `account.ui.com`, enumerate routes + APIs, test each route one-by-one (client-side then server-side), and document evidence in `result/`.
- Find valid high-impact findings (XSS with JS execution, CSTI, IDOR, BAC, open redirect allowing `javascript:`); send Discord webhook only on a genuinely confirmed finding.

## Important Details
- Repo root: `/home/runner/work/aaii-aautomattionn-for-doomainn/aaii-aautomattionn-for-doomainn`; fresh start (prior state reset, target hash changed).
- Scope: `account.ui.com` domain-only. `creds/test-account.txt` references `console.byteplus.com` → out of scope, not used.
- `result/scope.md`: APIs directly invoked by `account.ui.com` routes (`sso.ui.com`, `sso.ubnt.com`, `account.svc.ui.com`, `geo.svc.ui.com`) treated as required components; no roaming to unrelated subdomains.
- AGENT rules: practical evidence only, no DoS/brute force/destructive tests, no real-user data; out-of-scope items → `result/out-of-scope.txt`. `confirmed-vuln.txt` only accepts high-impact classes; explicitly excludes account-existence oracles, masked contact details, verification flags, sim issues. Severity: Critical | High | Medium.
- Tools: Chrome DevTools MCP (pageId 2), `google-chrome-stable` port 9222, node v22.23.4, python 3.14.4, curl; `rg` NOT installed (use python/grep).
- Bundle: `https://account.ui.com/assets/index-D5t7M7xo.js`, 7,121,868 bytes, sha256 `ce9950c975a42cac66f5c2ea759d655e96c441d34df6a6b8190b09d60ea1c468`; saved to `result/client-side/account.ui.com/_app/javascript/index-D5t7M7xo.js`. No source map.
- Route table extracted (42 `path:` values): `/`, `/account`, `/activate`, `/backups`, `/billing`, `/billing/:orgId`, `/idp/login-result`, `/invoices`, `/invoices/:invoiceId`, `/login`, `/login/change-email`, `/login/change-email/confirm`, `/login/create-passkey`, `/login/mfa`, `/login/trust-device`, `/logout`, `/msp/idp/setup-result`, `/mysupport`, `/payments`, `/payments/3ds`, `/profile`, `/register`, `/requests`, `/requests/:ticketId`, `/reset-password`, `/reset-password/password-reset-uuid/:uuid`, `/security`, `/security/suspicious/confirm`, `/subscribe`, `/subscriptions`, `/subscriptions/:service`, `/subscriptions/cloud-storage/subscribe`, `/subscriptions/site-support/subscribe`, `/supportform`, `/supportform-uisp`, `/supportform-umr`, `/switch`, `/verify`, `/verify/verification-code/:uuid`, `/sso/account`, `/sso/installs`, `/sso/cancel_subscription`.
- Key JS config: `accountBE` base `https://account.svc.ui.com`; `ssoUi` base `https://sso.ui.com`; `sso` base `https://sso.ubnt.com`; endpoints include `/api/sso/v2/users` (createAccount), `/api/sso/v1/search/email/{e}`, `/api/sso/v1/search/username/{u}`, `/api/sso/v1/login/email`, `/api/sso/v1/password/{user}`, `/api/sso/v1/verify/password/{uuid}`, `/api/sso/v1/verify/verification-code/{uuid}`, `/api/sso/v1/verify/{type}/{username}`, `/api/sso/v1/account-chooser`, `/api/sso/v1/legal`, `/api/sso/v1/address/validator`, `/api/sso/v1/password-strength`, `/api/sso/v1/idp/login-result`, `/api/sso/v1/user/{uuid}/roles/beta`, `/api/sso/v1/passwordless/options`, `/api/sso/v1/passwordless/login`, `/api/sso/v1/suspicious/confirm/inspect`, `/api/sso/v1/suspicious/confirm`, `/api/sso/v1/user/self/zendesk_user`, `/api/sso/v1/legacy/user/self/email/send`, `/api/sso/v1/legacy/user/self/email`, `/api/sso/v1/user/self/email/verify/send`, `/api/sso/v1/user/self/token/setup`, `/api/sso/v1/user/self/token/login`, `/api/sso/v1/user/self/login/level`, `/api/sso/v1/user/self/login/level/refresh`.
- Account.svc zendesk endpoints: `zendesk/user`, `zendesk/ticket`, `zendesk/tickets`, `zendesk/tickets/closed`, `zendesk/tickets/ccd`, `zendesk/search_tickets`, `zendesk/search_ccd`, `zendesk/comments`, `zendesk/comment`, `zendesk/ticket/{ticketId}/close`, `chat/messaging/jwt`.
- Redirect logic: `MC()` allows only http/https hosts whose last two labels ∈ [`ubnt.com`,`ui.com`,`uisp.com`]; `Wpe()` requires innerRedirect start `/`, not `//`, no `\`, prefix match allowlist `Lpe`. `/payments/3ds` reads `return_url` (not `url`) and validates via `MC`, redirecting only allowed hosts. `/switch` uses `redirect` via MC. `/logout` posts `window.location.href`. `/idp/login-result` does `window.location.replace(next)` with server-supplied `next` (400 on bad code). No open redirect confirmed yet.
- postMessage: main listener requires `e.source === window.parent` AND `$he(e.origin)` (`https://` + `MC`) then zod `safeParse`; MSP listener checks `origin === window.location.origin`; `/msp/idp/setup-result` posts to opener with targetOrigin `window.location.origin`. No issue found.
- XSS sinks: only 2 app-level `__html` (radix scroll-area style, html-react-parser library); `eval(`, `new Function`, `document.write` = 0. DOM XSS unlikely.
- reCAPTCHA keys: score key `Jzt`/`GOOGLE_RECAPTCHA_SECRET_SCORE` = `6LfGZXojAAAAAEtQpgRueRxoFwnjwe58b1exZGsS` (action `submit` lowercase); challenge key = `6LdWhNglAAAAAJB_RK6EWYVnSVyrohxdwy9WEkP8`; backend key = `6LfyUkwpAAAAAJ6-mN1q_IAe0bM8pit_lxc0anmv`.
- Registration payload: `{captcha, site_key:Jzt, email, username, password, curr_privacy_rev, curr_terms_rev, newsletter:{announcements,unifi,uisp}}` → `POST https://sso.ui.com/api/sso/v2/users`. Legal revs `REV2013-01-18`.
- CORS: `sso.ui.com` returns no ACAO for `evil.example`, `account.ui.com.evil.com`, `account.ui.com@evil.com`, `null`; returns ACAO + `allow-credentials: true` for `https://account.ui.com`, `https://ui.com`, `https://evilaccount.ui.com` (any `*.ui.com`) — expected shared SSO, not reported.
- Account creation unblocked: `chrome-devtools_emulate` with UA `Mozilla/5.0 (X11; Linux x86_64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/156.0.0.0 Safari/537.36`, viewport `1280x900x1`, colorScheme light → reCAPTCHA score accepted.
- Test account 1: `bbtest20261030a@fearlessmails.com` / user id `d1218be9-ff0c-4039-b3bc-3f1cec6f2702` — registered but unverified; `fearlessmails.com` has no A record (MX `inbound-smtp.us-east-1.amazonaws.com`, SquareX disposable), inbox unreadable → unusable.
- Test account 2 (fully verified, logged in): `bbtest20261030c@maxxspace.com` / password `Acd3423@#345566` / user UUID `41bc6e87-2274-4e46-a3a3-72d91bdc6257`; email authenticator id `b7b31d44-c0c5-4662-ab15-083182ca49fa`; session id `5ba318b3-6a37-4df9-920f-834d46a5a978`; IP `52.234.44.114` (San Jose). Verification email code `058050` (used). `UBIC_AUTH` cookie is HttpOnly JWT RS256; claims include `is_verified:true`, `mfa`, `sub` = user UUID.
