## Work State
### Completed
- Read `skills/AGENT.md`, `skills/client-side-skill.md`, `skills/server-side-skill.md`; preflight/tool checks done.
- Wrote `result/logs/session.md`, `result/scope.md`, `result/account-creation.md`, `result/inventory/routes.md`; created `result/{client-side,server-side,findings,inventory,logs}` and `result/client-side/account.ui.com/_app/javascript`, `result/server-side/account.ui.com/traffic`.
- Downloaded/analyzed production JS bundle; extracted routes, API config, redirect/postMessage/sink logic, reCAPTCHA keys, client auth/flow methods, zendesk endpoints.
- Account creation achieved via UA emulation; two accounts registered, second fully verified + logged in. `result/account-creation.md` needs updating to reflect success.
- Unauth route tests: `/login`, `/register`, `/reset-password` (PUT verify/password invalid uuid → 404; form shows for arbitrary uuid but token validated server-side); `/verify` → `/login`; `/verify/verification-code/:uuid` auto-triggers PUT verifyRegistration, shows "Email activation failed!", redirects `/login`; `/supportform` → `/login?innerRedirect=%2Flogin%3FinnerRedirect%3D%252Frequests`; `/supportform-uisp` → `/login?innerRedirect=%2Fsupportform-uisp`; `/supportform-umr` → `/login?innerRedirect=%2Frequests`; `/activate` → `https://activate.ui.com/` (out of scope); `/msp/idp/setup-result` → `/login?innerRedirect=%2Faccount`; `/idp/login-result?code=x&state=y` → POST `/api/sso/v1/idp/login-result` 400, page "Login session could not be verified".
- Unauth API probes: `/search/email/<fake>` 404; `/search/email/<real>` 204; `/search/username/<real>` 204; `/login/email` real → 200 `user_exists:true`; fake → 400/429; rate limit 429 `RATE_LIMITED` — user enumeration confirmed but excluded per AGENT as account-existence oracle.
- Authenticated probes (session 1): `/user/self/settings` 200; `/user/self/roles` 200 `{"roles":[]}`; `/user/self/mfa` 200; `/user/self/sessions` 200; `/user/self/trusted_devices` 200 `[]`; `/user/self/activity?source=sso&limit=5` 200; `/account-chooser` 200 `{"accounts":[]}`; `/user/self/login/level` 200.
- IDOR test: `POST /api/sso/v1/user/{uuid}/roles/beta` — GET 405; own uuid 204; other owned uuid `d1218be9-...` → 403 `"mismatching UUID"`; random `00000000-...` → 403. Proper ownership check, Not Vulnerable.
- Client code reviewed: `EC` class methods (`get`, `getSettings`, `update` via PUT, `updatePicture`, `updateSettings`, `login`, `loginUserCheck`, `loginMFA` POST `{token}`, `logout`, `delete` DELETE `{password}`, `changeEmail` POST `/user/self/email/verify/send` `{email}`, `changeOneTimeEmail` POST `/legacy/user/self/email/send` `{email,password}`, `confirmChangeOneTimeEmail` PUT `/legacy/user/self/email`); email change gated by `emailChangeable` + password; `/login/change-email` requires auth redirect otherwise; support flow uses `nw()` deep link to external help.ui.com; zendesk endpoints appear unused by account.ui.com routes.

### Active
- Investigating mass assignment on `PUT /api/sso/v1/user/self` (`EC.update` via `vC`): locating client caller/payload shape, then testing privileged fields (`is_verified`, `roles`, `uuid`, `email`, `twofa_enabled`) one at a time on own account and verifying persisted state.

### Blocked
- Need a second readable/verified test account for cross-account IDOR/BAC tests (mail.tm address e.g. `bbtest20261030d@maxxspace.com`; create in an isolated Chrome context to keep both sessions). Not yet created.
- No confirmed high-impact vulnerability yet; Discord notification not sent.
- `rg` unavailable; use python3/grep.
- Account 1 unverified/unusable (unreadable inbox).

